; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 17.25px; font-family: sans-serif;\">PROJECTS SHOW</span></strong></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-top: -10px;margin-right: -13px;margin-left: auto;width: 30px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<svg style=\"display: block;\" viewbox=\"0 0 53 29\" xml:space=\"default\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g data-name=\"图层 2\"><g data-name=\"图层 1\"><g><path d=\"M38.05,0a3.38,3.38,0,1,1-3.39,3.38A3.38,3.38,0,0,1,38.05,0Z\" style=\"fill:#73d2ca;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M49.61,0a3.38,3.38,0,1,1-3.39,3.38A3.38,3.38,0,0,1,49.61,0Z\" style=\"fill:#73d2ca;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M38.05,11.47a3.38,3.38,0,1,1-3.39,3.37A3.38,3.38,0,0,1,38.05,11.47Z\" style=\"fill:#73d2ca;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M49.61,11.47a3.38,3.38,0,1,1-3.39,3.37A3.38,3.38,0,0,1,49.61,11.47Z\" style=\"fill:#73d2ca;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M3.39,22.25A3.38,3.38,0,1,1,0,25.63,3.38,3.38,0,0,1,3.39,22.25Z\" style=\"fill:#73d2ca;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M15,22.25a3.38,3.38,0,1,1-3.39,3.38A3.38,3.38,0,0,1,15,22.25Z\" style=\"fill:#73d2ca;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M26.5,22.25a3.38,3.38,0,1,1-3.41,3.38A3.4,3.4,0,0,1,26.5,22.25Z\" style=\"fill:#73d2ca;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M38.05,22.25a3.38,3.38,0,1,1-3.39,3.38A3.38,3.38,0,0,1,38.05,22.25Z\" style=\"fill:#73d2ca;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M49.61,22.25a3.38,3.38,0,1,1-3.39,3.38A3.38,3.38,0,0,1,49.61,22.25Z\" style=\"fill:#73d2ca;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g></g></g></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"148037\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #2c9650;border-radius: 5px;padding: 15px 15px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2.06799em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; caret-color: red;\">机电工程方面</strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; caret-color: red;\">：在机电安装、调试、维护等领域拥有丰富的经验和卓越的技术实力，承接过明珠污水处理厂、从化水质净化厂提标改造工程设计－采购－施工总承包（EPC）项目、洛溪岛裕景花园等小区临时截污处理工程一体化设施及采购项目、2023-2025年从化区吕田镇、良口镇、温泉镇农村生活污水治理提升工程等。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 2em; margin-bottom: 10px; text-indent: 2.06799em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>给排水工程方面</strong>：完成了广州市白云区排水管线隐患排查（结构性缺陷）修复工程、从化区鳌头镇排水设施养护项目、天河区排水管线隐患排查修复工程（沙河涌流域）等。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 2em; margin-bottom: 10px; text-indent: 2.06799em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>在市政类维修项目方面</strong>，完成了广州从化净水有限公司2023年市政工程类日常维护维修项目、广州市白云区钟落潭镇人民政府农村生活污水处理设施维修养护服务等。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100014065\" data-ratio=\"0.3851851851851852\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202505/%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA-%E6%94%B9.jpg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;\" type=\"block\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 2em; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>"}